      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it has long been recognized that alcoholism and alcohol abuse (\"Alcohol abuse\") and mental and emotional problems have a serious impact on the health, welfare, and social life of the individual, the individuals' family, co-workers, and the community; and",
